# Lazily-downloaded CorpusQA tier files — fetched on first get_task_ids()/get_task()
# by download_data.ensure (128k ≈ 103 MB, 1m ≈ 1 GB, from Hugging Face).
# NOT vendored — far too large, and reconstructible on demand. The small offset
# index built over each tier (loader._build_index) is likewise regenerable.
/*_4domains.jsonl
/*_index_*.jsonl
/*.jsonl.part
/*.index.part
/.*.lock
